### cake retrieve api
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/cakes/1/


### cake patch api
PATCH  http://127.0.0.1:8000/cakes/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Red Velvet",
    "description": "Yummy yummyyy",
    "price": 1500
}

### cake delete api
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/cakes/1/

### create a shape
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/shapes/
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=abc

--abc
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

round

--abc

